                    "exact": "English",
                    "prefix": "Calmly, therefore, he begins to speak of war,\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\tpraises the virtue of being Canadien,of being at peace, of faith, of family,and suddenly his other voice: Where are your sons?\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\tHe is tearful, choking tears; but not hewould blame the clever",
